{
  "id": "feature_freshman_welcome_party_drunk_seduction",
  "title": "【歓迎会の二次会帰りに始まる下剋上】新入社員×歓迎会特集！居酒屋の個室や先輩の部屋で泥酔した新人OLを朝まで生ハメし尽くす名作選",
  "content": "\n<div class=\"space-y-12 text-slate-200\">\n  <!-- イントロダクション -->\n  <section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900 border border-pink-500/20 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-pink-500/20 text-pink-400 border border-pink-500/40 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">厳選ディープ特集</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">公式FANZA Web API リアルタイムデータ取得</span>\n    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 leading-relaxed\">【歓迎会の二次会帰りに始まる下剋上】新入社員×歓迎会特集！居酒屋の個室や先輩の部屋で泥酔した新人OLを朝まで生ハメし尽くす名作選</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6\">春の夜、緊張した面持ちで乾杯を繰り返す新入社員の歓迎会。二次会を終え、アルコールで頬を赤く染めた新人OL。「もう歩けないです…」と寄り添ってくる無防備な身体をタクシーに乗せ、ホテルで新社会人の洗礼として激しく奥深くまで注ぎ込む——。</p>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 p-4 bg-slate-950/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-700/50 text-sm\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <span class=\"text-pink-400\">🎯</span>\n        <span class=\"text-slate-300\"><strong>検索意図:</strong> 4月の新歓コンパや歓迎会で酒を飲まされた初々しい新入社員の女子が、先輩や上司にお持ち帰りされてハメられるAVを探しているユーザー向け</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <span class=\"text-pink-400\">🔑</span>\n        <span class=\"text-slate-300\"><strong>中核キーワード:</strong> 新入社員・歓迎会・新人OL・居酒屋個室・泥酔・二次会・終電逃し・生中出し</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <span class=\"text-pink-400\">⚡</span>\n        <span class=\"text-slate-300\"><strong>収録作品数:</strong> 厳選4タイトル（全作API直結）</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 比較マトリクス表 -->\n  <section class=\"space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-l-4 border-pink-500 pl-3\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white\">【徹底比較】特集収録作品 スペック一覧マトリクス</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/80 shadow-md\">\n      <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-300 divide-y divide-slate-800\">\n        <thead class=\"bg-slate-950/80 text-pink-400 font-semibold\">\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"p-3\">作品名 / 品番</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3\">主演出演者</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3\">メーカー / レーベル</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3\">抜きどころ・最大の見せ場</th>\n            <th class=\"p-3 text-center\">公式配信</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-800/60\">\n          <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-medium text-white max-w-xs truncate\">居酒屋痴●3 新入社員歓迎会SP <br><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-400 font-mono\">1NHDTB00394</span></td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">単体・企画女優</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">ナチュラルハイ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">至近距離密着ピストン＆濃厚フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D1nhdtb00394&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-medium text-white max-w-xs truncate\">居酒屋痴●6 新入社員歓迎会中出しSP <br><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-400 font-mono\">1NHDTB00761</span></td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">単体・企画女優</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">ナチュラルハイ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">至近距離密着ピストン＆濃厚フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D1nhdtb00761&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-medium text-white max-w-xs truncate\">社員旅行でベロ酔いした新人OLの浴衣が乱れノーブラ勃起乳首が丸見えに。介抱するフリして集団乱交したら… <br><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-400 font-mono\">118KIL00108</span></td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">単体・企画女優</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">ゲッツ！！ボンボン/妄想族</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">至近距離密着ピストン＆濃厚フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D118kil00108&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-medium text-white max-w-xs truncate\">変態研修の餌食になったHカップ爆乳OL 愛内ゆう <br><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-400 font-mono\">83SMA00557</span></td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">愛内ゆう</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">MARX</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">至近距離密着ピストン＆濃厚フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D83sma00557&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 作品別徹底詳細レビュー（1作品ずつ長文解説） -->\n  <section class=\"space-y-12\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-l-4 border-pink-500 pl-3\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white\">【完全個別レビュー】厳選収録作品の深層分析＆抜きどころ解説</h3>\n    </div>\n    <article class=\"bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 shadow-2xl\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-4 border-b border-slate-800\">\n        <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-full shadow\">FILE 01</span>\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-pink-400 tracking-wider\">品番: 1NHDTB00394</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4 class=\"text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold text-white leading-snug hover:text-pink-400 transition\">居酒屋痴●3 新入社員歓迎会SP</h4>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start\">\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-5 space-y-3\">\n          <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 shadow-inner group\">\n            <img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/1nhdtb00394/1nhdtb00394pl.jpg\" alt=\"居酒屋痴●3 新入社員歓迎会SP\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-3 bg-slate-950/80 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 text-xs space-y-1 text-slate-400 font-mono\">\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">出演女優:</strong> 厳選実力派キャスト</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">メーカー:</strong> ナチュラルハイ</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">レーベル:</strong> ----</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">参考価格:</strong> 300~</div>\n          </div>\n          <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3D1nhdtb00394&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block w-full text-center py-3 px-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-600 to-rose-600 hover:from-pink-500 hover:to-rose-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition duration-150\">\n            FANZA公式で作品詳細